
1. Quotation

Quatation for both Mobile Wallet and Bank transfer are similar but with slight difference on:
    a. For Mobile wallet, destination.bicWallet field, MOBILE_WALLET_ must be prefixed before the mobile wallet name (in this case MTN Mobile Money).
    b. For Bank transfer, destination.bicWallet holds the Swift code (bic code) for that particular bank

Also, Note:
    a. In the bank transfer option, destination.accountNumber can either be and account number, iban, or clabe(Clabe is account number equivalent in Mexico)
    b. mode supply THUNES when sending to Thunes or MASTERCARD when sending to Mastercard

